Package: bcapture
Type: Package
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Title: Capture and Organize Biosecurity Compliance Audit Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("JM Humphreys", email = "jmh09r@my.fsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: JM Humphreys [aut, cre]
Maintainer: JM Humphreys <jmh09r@my.fsu.edu>
Description: Extracts structured data from Biosecurity Compliance Audit Program
    PDF forms and provides infrastructure for organizing, validating,
    summarizing, and eventually viewing audit results. The current extractor
    supports electronically completed HPAI forms with interactive AcroForm
    fields; scanned and handwritten forms are not supported yet.
